  explanation:
    en: "We are in the EU, but we kept our own money. 'Z\u0142oty' literally means
      'Golden', even if the inflation sometimes suggests otherwise."
    native: "Jeste\u015Bmy w Unii, ale zachowali\u015Bmy w\u0142asny pieni\u0105dz.
      'Z\u0142oty' to dumna nazwa, nawet je\u015Bli inflacja czasem sugeruje co innego."
